    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d927">

                <pb facs="0893" n="881" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg881"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.515/21: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Moose</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-26T13:00:00+03:06">July 26, 1943—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:08 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>73. My 66, July 14, 6 p.m. Saudi Government agreed on July 21 to accept from oil
                    company rupee equivalent of $500,000.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moose</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
